# switch-with-values (H6): x³ picked at a=2. The switch (old x² fading,
# new x³ drawing on) composes with the transform: each switch curve shows
# transformed, the dashed originals behind. The x³ cell's centre is
# (257.5, 187): the third 83 px cell in the options row (x²'s is
# (174.5, 187)), probed on the reference at 5196. Behaviour: url line
# func=x3&a=2 right after the click; the mid shot shows the half-drawn
# transformed x³.
size 1440 900
density 2
scheme dark
mode dark
theme arctic-ice
query func=x2&a=2
wait 2000
click 257.5 187
wait 300
shot switch-with-values-mid
wait 2000
shot switch-with-values
